                    September 2026
                </strong>

                </div>

            </div>


            <div class="privacy-layout">


                <article class="privacy-card">


                    <div class="privacy-introduction">

                        <div class="intro-icon">
                            🔒
                        </div>


                        <div>

                            <h2>
                                Your Privacy Matters
                            </h2>

                            <p>
                                At XTP Academy, we respect your privacy and are committed to handling your information responsibly.
                            </p>

                            <p>
                                This Privacy Policy explains what information we may collect, why we collect it, how it may be used, and the choices available to you.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </div>


                    <section class="privacy-section" id="information">

                        <span class="section-number">
                        01
                    </span>

                        <div>

                            <h2>
                                Information We Collect
                            </h2>

                            <p>
                                When you use XTP Academy, we may collect information that is necessary to provide our services.
                            </p>

                            <h3>
                                Information you provide
                            </h3>

                            <ul>
                                <li>Name and account information.</li>
                                <li>Email address and contact information.</li>
                                <li>Information provided during registration.</li>
                                <li>Course enrollment information.</li>
                                <li>Messages or information sent to our support team.</li>
                            </ul>


                            <h3>
                                Information collected automatically
                            </h3>

                            <ul>
                                <li>Browser and device information.</li>
                                <li>Pages and features you access.</li>
                                <li>General usage information.</li>
                                <li>Technical information needed to operate and secure the platform.</li>
                            </ul>

                        </div>

                    </section>


                    <section class="privacy-section" id="usage">

                        <span class="section-number">
                        02
                    </span>

                        <div>

                            <h2>
                                How We Use Information
                            </h2>

                            <p>
                                Information may be used to operate, maintain, secure, and improve XTP Academy.
                            </p>

                            <ul>
                                <li>Create and manage student accounts.</li>
                                <li>Provide access to courses and learning materials.</li>
                                <li>Process course purchases and payments.</li>
                                <li>Respond to support requests.</li>
                                <li>Send important account or service communications.</li>
                                <li>Improve our website and learning experience.</li>
                                <li>Detect and prevent fraud, abuse, or security problems.</li>
                            </ul>

                        </div>

                    </section>


                    <section class="privacy-section" id="payments">

                        <span class="section-number">
                        03
                    </span>

                        <div>

                            <h2>
                                Payments
                            </h2>

                            <p>
                                When you purchase a course, payment processing may be handled by a third-party payment provider.
                            </p>

                            <p>
                                Payment information may be processed according to the payment provider's own privacy policy and security practices.
                            </p>

                            <div class="notice-box">

                                <strong>
                                Important:
                            </strong> XTP Academy does not need to store your complete payment-card information in order to provide access to a course.

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </section>


                    <section class="privacy-section" id="emails">

                        <span class="section-number">
                        04
                    </span>

                        <div>

                            <h2>
                                Emails & Communications
                            </h2>

                            <p>
                                We may use your email address to send important communications related to your account and use of the Academy.
                            </p>

                            <ul>
                                <li>Account registration confirmations.</li>
                                <li>Login or account-related notifications.</li>
                                <li>Course-related information.</li>
                                <li>Payment or transaction notifications.</li>
                                <li>Support responses.</li>
                                <li>Important service updates.</li>
                            </ul>

                            <p>
                                Where applicable, promotional communications may provide an option to unsubscribe.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </section>


                    <section class="privacy-section" id="cookies">

                        <span class="section-number">
                        05
                    </span>

                        <div>

                            <h2>
                                Cookies & Similar Technologies
                            </h2>

                            <p>
                                XTP Academy may use cookies or similar technologies to support website functionality, remember preferences, maintain sessions, and understand how the platform is used.
                            </p>

                            <p>
                                Your browser may allow you to control or disable cookies. Some features of the website may not function correctly if required cookies are disabled.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </section>


                    <section class="privacy-section" id="security">

                        <span class="section-number">
                        06
                    </span>

                        <div>

                            <h2>
                                Data Security
                            </h2>

                            <p>
                                We take reasonable steps to protect information from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.
                            </p>

                            <p>
                                However, no internet transmission or electronic storage system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </section>


                    <section class="privacy-section" id="sharing">

                        <span class="section-number">
                        07
                    </span>

                        <div>

                            <h2>
                                Information Sharing
                            </h2>

                            <p>
                                We do not intend to sell your personal information.
                            </p>

                            <p>
                                Information may be shared when necessary to operate the Academy, provide services, process payments, respond to legal requirements, or protect the security and rights of XTP Academy and its users.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </section>


                    <section class="privacy-section" id="third-party">

                        <span class="section-number">
                        08
                    </span>

                        <div>

                            <h2>
                                Third-Party Services
                            </h2>

                            <p>
                                XTP Academy may use third-party services for functions such as payment processing, email delivery, hosting, analytics, or other technical services.
                            </p>

                            <p>
                                These providers may process information according to their own terms and privacy policies.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </section>


                    <section class="privacy-section" id="retention">

                        <span class="section-number">
                        09
                    </span>

                        <div>

                            <h2>
                                Data Retention
                            </h2>

                            <p>
                                We may retain information for as long as reasonably necessary to provide our services, maintain records, resolve disputes, enforce agreements, and meet applicable legal or operational requirements.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </section>


                    <section class="privacy-section" id="rights">

                        <span class="section-number">
                        10
                    </span>

                        <div>

                            <h2>
                                Your Privacy Choices
                            </h2>

                            <p>
                                Depending on applicable law, you may have rights concerning the personal information associated with your account.
                            </p>

                            <p>
                                You may contact us to ask questions about your information, request corrections, or request other privacy-related assistance.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </section>


                    <section class="privacy-section" id="children">

                        <span class="section-number">
                        11
                    </span>

                        <div>

                            <h2>
                                Children's Privacy
                            </h2>

                            <p>
                                XTP Academy is an educational platform. Where users are children or young people, account creation and use should be carried out with appropriate parental or guardian involvement where required by applicable law.
                            </p>

                            <p>
                                If you believe that information belonging to a child has been provided to us improperly, please contact our support team.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </section>


                    <section class="privacy-section" id="changes">

                        <span class="section-number">
                        12
                    </span>

                        <div>

                            <h2>
                                Changes to This Privacy Policy
                            </h2>

                            <p>
                                We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time as our services, technology, or legal obligations change.
                            </p>

                            <p>
                                The latest version will be published on this page together with the applicable update date.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </section>


                    <section class="privacy-section" id="contact">

                        <span class="section-number">
                        13
                    </span>

                        <div>

                            <h2>
                                Contact Us
                            </h2>

                            <p>
                                If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how your information is handled, please contact XTP Academy.
                            </p>

                            <a href="/contact" class="contact-button">
                            Contact Support
                        </a>

                        </div>

                    </section>


                    <div class="privacy-footer-note">

                        <div class="check-icon">
                            ✓
                        </div>

                        <p>
                            We are committed to treating your information responsibly and providing a trustworthy learning experience.
                        </p>

                    </div>


